# ============================================================================
# PROMPTADMIN ENTERPRISE CONTROL PANEL - EXTERNAL SERVICE CONFIGURATION
# ============================================================================
# Configure values via the Secrets panel in Google AI Studio.
#
# SECURITY RULE:
# NEVER store your private OneSignal REST API Key in client-side code or APK.
# Deploy /cloud-functions/onesignal-notify to Firebase Cloud Functions, store
# the OneSignal REST API Key in Google Cloud Secret Manager, and provide only
# the Cloud Function HTTPS endpoint below.
#
# Optional configuration keys (uncomment in AI Studio Secrets if overriding defaults):
# ONESIGNAL_APP_ID=YOUR_ONESIGNAL_PUBLIC_APP_ID
# ONESIGNAL_DISPATCH_FUNCTION_URL=https://us-central1-your-project.cloudfunctions.net/sendOneSignalNotification
# ADMIN_AUTH_FUNCTION_URL=https://us-central1-your-project.cloudfunctions.net/manageUserAccount
# DEEP_LINK_SCHEME=promptvault
